.input|xwiki/2.1
.# Verify that code spans can't be ended by their content and that backticks next to them are escaped
.#-----------------------------------------------------
a ##b`~{~{info}}c~{~{/info}}`## d

a ##`b## {{code}}c`{{info}}d{{/info}}`{{/code}} e

a ##b\\~<span>c~</span>## d

a`{{code}}b{{/code}}` c
